cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use X-Ray Calc 3 in your research, please cite the article below."
type: software
title: "X-Ray Calc 3"
abstract: >-
  X-Ray Calc 3 is a Windows program for the simulation of X-ray reflectivity (XRR)
  of layered structures and for fitting measured curves with a particle-swarm
  optimiser (LFPSO). The repository also holds the command-line interface, the XRF
  mirror-design program XRFCalc, and XRC_MCP, a server that exposes the same
  calculation engine to LLM agents over the Model Context Protocol.
